        <p>The findings of this audit provide <b>{{clientName}}</b> with clear visibility into the risks associated with <b>{{targetName}}</b> and a framework for prioritising corrective actions based on identified risk levels. The recommendations aim to strengthen the overall security posture while accounting for the organisation's business requirements and technical constraints.</p>

